abstract: >-
  Main X Index: a federated identity index implemented as a family of
  Rust services (loco.rs, Axum, SeaORM, PostgreSQL) — entity
  registries with probabilistic and deterministic matching, full-text
  search, record merge, audit trails, event streaming, and SvelteKit
  operator front-ends.
